   $q$Which sentence least fits the formal style of the argument and should be revised or removed?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (11)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (3)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (6)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (11)$q$, $q$Sentence (11) uses casual language and offers an undeveloped point with no evidence. Sentence (6) is needed because it states the main opposing concern that the writer answers.$q$, 'draft', '1da3ac6d-cafc-54ab-b5b7-20736871f430')
