  ('dfd07f36-da9c-5f56-bc13-e92ded913a77', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which detail would best strengthen the response in sentence (8)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Many professional leagues use video review with very expensive camera systems.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-relevance"},{"text":"During a one-season trial in the Lakemont league, reviews averaged ninety seconds and occurred about once every three games.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Two minutes is not very long compared with an entire school day.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"faulty-comparison"},{"text":"Players often get tired and lose focus when games run longer than usual.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-opposing-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$During a one-season trial in the Lakemont league, reviews averaged ninety seconds and occurred about once every three games.$q$, $q$The Lakemont trial gives direct evidence that limited review causes short, infrequent stoppages, which is exactly what sentence (8) claims. The note about players tiring supports the opposing side instead.$q$, 'draft', '175c0575-5051-5d8e-99de-5188c2c476d4')
