  ('478f8290-e565-5ffb-934e-abb1892f7b41', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-informative-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence 14 as a conclusion that articulates the significance of the topic?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Everyone should donate old home movies to an archive right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-call-to-action"},{"text":"Nitrate film decomposes in stages, starting with fading and ending in powder.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"By combining cold storage with careful copying, archivists give a fragile medium a second life, preserving a visual record of the past that would otherwise disappear.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Some archives also preserve old photographs, posters and scripts.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$By combining cold storage with careful copying, archivists give a fragile medium a second life, preserving a visual record of the past that would otherwise disappear.$q$, $q$The correct sentence joins the two strategies from paragraphs 3 and 4 and explains why the work matters. Summarizing the stages of decay repeats paragraph 2 without stating any significance.$q$, 'draft', 'f2f16490-877e-5795-bcc8-8881e3af32e0')
