   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it does not belong in the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 10","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-event"},{"text":"sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-character-detail"},{"text":"sentence 13","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-climax"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 10$q$, $q$The price of the telescope interrupts the tense moment between the narrator's doubt and the clouds opening. Sentence 8 should stay because the departing members raise the pressure to give up.$q$, 'draft', '889c5e8c-d2ae-54ab-bcb8-2938fb757d75')
