  ('c23d81da-bc87-5408-980e-551f08cebbf5', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-sentence-structure'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Read the sentences: "Anaya Brightwater is a marine biologist. She tags sea turtles off the coast. Her data show that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest." Which choice combines them most effectively?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Anaya Brightwater, a marine biologist who tags sea turtles off the coast, has gathered data showing that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Anaya Brightwater is a marine biologist, she tags sea turtles off the coast, and her data show that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"comma-splice-created"},{"text":"A marine biologist who tags sea turtles off the coast, Anaya Brightwater's data show that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dangling-appositive"},{"text":"Anaya Brightwater, a marine biologist who tags sea turtles off the coast, her data show that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"double-subject-fragment"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Anaya Brightwater, a marine biologist who tags sea turtles off the coast, has gathered data showing that the turtles return to the same beaches to nest.$q$, $q$The appositive renames Anaya, and "Anaya" is the subject of "has gathered," so every part connects correctly. Opening with "A marine biologist..." before "Anaya Brightwater's data" makes the data, not the person, seem to be the biologist.$q$, 'draft', null)
